    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "When sunlight goes into a raindrop, it bends. Each colour bends a different amount, so they spread apart. Then the light bounces back out toward you.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "Inside a raindrop",
